{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"同伦(余)极限"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"title":[{"Plain":"同伦 (余) 极限"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>单纯集</h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"单纯集","text":"单纯集"}},{"Plain":"映射 $f\\colon A\\to B$, $g\\colon A\\to C$ 的同伦推出是单纯集\n$$\r\nB\\sqcup_{\\{0\\}\\times A} (\\Delta^1\\times A) \\sqcup_{\\{1\\}\\times A} C.\r\n$$</p>\n<h3>单纯模型范畴</h3>\n<p>在单纯模型范畴中, 一个图是同伦极限图当且仅当在相应的"},{"Local":{"url":"拟范畴","text":"拟范畴"}},{"Plain":"中它构成极限图.</p>\n"}]}}